{"ref":"BDB, מוּם","hw":"מוּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מוּם</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.17\">Lv 21:17</a></sup> (= foregoing; quiesc. א om.) <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּמָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܽܘܡܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.17\">Lv 21:17</a> + 16 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.7\">Pr 9:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּמָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.5\">Dt 32:5</a>;—<em>blemish, defect</em> (chiefly H):<br><strong>1.</strong>  physical, <strong>a.</strong>  in man, as excluding from priestly service, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.17\">Lv 21:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.21\">21</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.23\">23</a>; disfiguring man <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.25\">2 S 14:25</a>, woman <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.7\">Ct 4:7</a>; (in all <span dir=\"rtl\">היה מ׳ בְּ</span>); as caused by man upon man <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.19\">Lv 24:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.20\">20</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  in beast (ref. to sacrifice) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.20\">Lv 22:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:2\" href=\"/Numbers.19.2\">Nu 19:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.21\">Dt 15:21</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.1\">17:1</a> (in all <span dir=\"rtl\">היה מ׳ בְּ</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  fig. of moral blemish <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.5\">Dt 32:5</a> (but text very dubious, cf. Dr); <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשָּׂא פָנֶיךָ מִמּוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:15\" href=\"/Job.11.15\">Jb 11:15</a>; of shame of repulse <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.7\">Pr 9:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קָלוֹן</span>).","next":"BDB, מְא֫וּמָה","prev":"BDB, מאוּם"}